# ── Living Page monorepo ignores ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Root-level policy. Subprojects (Backend/) keep their own .gitignore too.

# ── Secrets / environment files ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Never commit real environment files. Example templates are the exception.
.env
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example
!*.env.example

# ── Node / TypeScript (Backend) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
dist/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
*.log
logs/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# ── Xcode / iPadApp build products & user state ──────────────────────────────
DerivedData/
**/DerivedData/
*.xcresult
**/*.xcresult
xcuserdata/
**/xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
build/

# ── Generated Xcode project ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# project.yml is the source of truth; the .xcodeproj is generated by XcodeGen.
# Regenerate locally with `xcodegen generate`.
iPadApp/LivingPage.xcodeproj/

# ── macOS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*

# ── Local agent memory ──
.remember/
